---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import { Picture } from 'astro:assets';
import profilePicture from '../assets/images/resume/thamara.png';

const pageTitle = "Resume - Thamara Kandabada";
---
<PageLayout title={pageTitle}>

    <h1>Resume</h1>
    
    <div class="resume-header">
      <div class="resume-photo">
        <Picture
          src={profilePicture} alt="Profile photo of Thamara Kandabada"
          formats={['avif', 'webp']}
        />
      </div>
      <div class="resume-details">
        <h2>Thamara Kandabada</h2>
        <p>I am a Sri Lankan professional currently living and working in Belfast, Northern Ireland. I have a keen eye for detail and a strong work ethic. I pride myself in my ability to adapt and learn new things—be it technology, operational processes, or creative endeavours. In my free time, I frequent the cinema, playing guitar, game, read, and tinker with this website.</p>
        <div class="resume-contact">
          <p><a href="mailto:t@thamara.co.uk"><i class="bi bi-envelope"></i> Email</a></p>
          <p><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/thamarakandabada/"><i class="bi bi-linkedin"></i> LinkedIn</a></p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <h3 class="resume-heading">Timeline</h3>
    <div class="resume-timeline">
      <div class="resume-2017">
        <h3>2017</h3>
        <p>Left my job in marketing to start my own business. Built a very successful e-commerce business over the next 5+ years.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="resume-2020">
        <h3>2020</h3>
        <p>Started a manufacturing arm for the business. Developed key skills in the apparel manufacturing sector.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="resume-2022">
        <h3>2022</h3>
        <p>Moved to Belfast to support my partner with her further education plans. Started working at <a href="https://deskwarehouse.co.uk/" target="_blank">Desk Warehouse</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <h3 class="resume-heading">Experience</h3>
    <div class="resume-experience">
      <h4>Desk Warehouse | Belfast, UK <span class="current">current</span></h4>
      <p>Desk Warehouse is the leading office furniture supplier in Northern Ireland. Our showrooms are based in a large converted Victorian linen mill, and we have an extensive selection of new, clearance and used office furniture to suit any requirement.</p>
      <div class="resume-experience-role">
        <div>
          <p class="resume-experience-role-title">General Manager</p>
          <p class="resume-experience-role-title-duration">Feb 2024–Present</p>
        </div>
        <div class="resume-experience-role-description">
          <p>While making sure all aspects of the day-to-day run smoothly, I also take primary responsibility for the sales pipeline of the business.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="resume-experience-role">
        <div>
          <p class="resume-experience-role-title">Admin Manager</p>
          <p class="resume-experience-role-title-duration">Nov 2022–Feb 2024</p>
        </div>
        <div class="resume-experience-role-description">
          <p>Daily admin tasks including showroom operations, online/offline sales support, order processing, delivery route planning, customer support, credit control and marketing content creation.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <h4>Bear Appeal & Bear Supply Global | Nugegoda, Sri Lanka</h4>
      <p>Bear Appeal is a men’s clothing brand that is all about convenience and peace-of-mind. Offering high quality everyday wear that help you get through your day, Bear Appeal boasts an extremely loyal customer base, which continues to expand thanks to a tried and tested customer-centric formula. In 2022, Bear Appeal expanded into the Maldives market.</p>
      <p>Bear Supply Global is an apparel manufacturing company, primarily founded as the production arm for the Bear Appeal brand. Since then, Bear Supply Global has expanded operations to service other clients such as Uber Sri Lanka, 99x Technology, Calcey Technologies, CodeGen International, Surge Global, and more.</p>
      <div class="resume-experience-role">
        <div>
          <p class="resume-experience-role-title">Co-Founder & Director</p>
          <p class="resume-experience-role-title-duration">Apr 2017–Sept 2022</p>
        </div>
        <div class="resume-experience-role-description">
          <p>Primary responsibilities:
            <ul>
             <li>One of the key decision makers for the company regarding all matters</li>
             <li>Corporate account management</li>
             <li>Production floor supervision</li>
    General administration
    Supervision of all day-to-day operations including order management, fulfilment, customer service, inventory management, supply chain and finances
    Team building, coaching and training
    Representing the company at industry events and in the media
            </ul>
Notable achievements:

    Cutting down production lead time by more than half (compared to outsourced manufacturing)
    Maintaining low production costs, enabling us to keep Bear Appeal products affordable through the pandemic and an economic crisis
    Creating a fully bootstrapped profit-making startup with no external funding
    Offering exceptional customer service and great products (Rated 4.9/5 on Google with 1000+ reviews)
    Growing sales and new customer acquisitions through a pandemic
    Excellent customer retention and loyalty throughout the years
    Offering a lenient refund/exchange policy to all customers
</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

</PageLayout>x